@startuml
actor User
participant "User Profile UI" as UI <<UI>>
participant ":UserEndpoints" as UserEndpoints <<Controller>>
participant ":ChangePasswordCommandHandler" as ChangePasswordCommandHandler <<Handler>>
participant ":IdentityService" as IdentityService <<Service>>

note right of ChangePasswordCommandHandler
  Managed by MediatR
end note

note right of IdentityService
  Managed by IoC
end note

User -> UI : Enter current and new password, click "Change Password"
activate UI
UI -> UserEndpoints : PATCH /api/User/ChangePassword
activate UserEndpoints
UserEndpoints -> ChangePasswordCommandHandler : Handle(ChangePasswordCommand)
deactivate UserEndpoints
activate ChangePasswordCommandHandler
ChangePasswordCommandHandler -> IdentityService : ChangePasswordAsync(userId, currentPassword, newPassword)
deactivate ChangePasswordCommandHandler
activate IdentityService
alt Invalid Current Password
    IdentityService --> ChangePasswordCommandHandler : Error: INVALID_CREDENTIALS
    deactivate IdentityService
    activate ChangePasswordCommandHandler
    ChangePasswordCommandHandler -> UserEndpoints : Error: INVALID_CREDENTIALS
    deactivate ChangePasswordCommandHandler
    activate UserEndpoints
    UserEndpoints --> UI : 400 Bad Request { "error": "INVALID_CREDENTIALS" }
    deactivate UserEndpoints
    UI -> User : Display error: Invalid current password
else New Password Requirements Not Met
    activate IdentityService
    IdentityService --> ChangePasswordCommandHandler : Error: PASSWORD_REQUIREMENTS_NOT_MET
    deactivate IdentityService
    activate ChangePasswordCommandHandler
    ChangePasswordCommandHandler -> UserEndpoints : Error: PASSWORD_REQUIREMENTS_NOT_MET
    deactivate ChangePasswordCommandHandler
    activate UserEndpoints
    UserEndpoints --> UI : 400 Bad Request { "error": "PASSWORD_REQUIREMENTS_NOT_MET" }
    deactivate UserEndpoints
    UI -> User : Display error: New password does not meet requirements
else Password Change Success
    activate IdentityService
    IdentityService --> ChangePasswordCommandHandler : Guid (userId)
    deactivate IdentityService
    activate ChangePasswordCommandHandler
    ChangePasswordCommandHandler -> UserEndpoints : Guid
    deactivate ChangePasswordCommandHandler
    activate UserEndpoints
    UserEndpoints --> UI : 200 OK (ApiResponse<Guid>)
    deactivate UserEndpoints
    UI -> User : Display info: Password changed successfully
end
deactivate UI

@enduml